
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Rovolox - Home</title>
<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #eef1f8;
  color: #202943;
}
header {
  height: 65px;
  background: #202b4b;
  color: white;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 0 25px;
}
.logo { font-size: 27px; font-weight: 900; color: #a99aff; }
header a { color: white; text-decoration: none; }
.layout { display: flex; min-height: calc(100vh - 65px); }
aside {
  width: 230px;
  background: white;
  padding: 20px 12px;
  border-right: 1px solid #dce1ed;
}
.user {
  padding: 15px 10px;
  display: flex;
  gap: 12px;
  align-items: center;
  font-weight: bold;
}
.avatar {
  width: 42px;
  height: 42px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #7661e8;
  color: white;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  font-size: 19px;
}
nav a {
  display: block;
  padding: 13px;
  margin: 4px 0;
  color: #39445e;
  text-decoration: none;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-weight: 600;
}
nav a:hover, nav a.active {
  background: #eeeaff;
  color: #6854dc;
}
main { flex: 1; padding: 35px; max-width: 1100px; }
h1 { font-size: 32px; }
.welcome {
  background: linear-gradient(120deg,#30275f,#7560e9);
  color: white;
  padding: 35px;
  border-radius: 16px;
}
.welcome p { color: #e1ddff; }
button {
  border: 0;
  padding: 13px 22px;
  background: white;
  color: #5946ca;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-weight: bold;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.cards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(190px,1fr));
  gap: 17px;
  margin-top: 25px;
}
.card {
  background: white;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 22px;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px #17254a0c;
}
.card a { color: #6854dc; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; }
footer { text-align: center; padding: 25px; color: #8490a8; }
@media(max-width:650px) {
  .layout { display: block; }
  aside { width: 100%; }
  nav { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  main { padding: 18px; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="logo">ROVOLOX</div>
  <a href="../welcome/">Log out</a>
</header>

<div class="layout">
<aside>
  <div class="user">
    <div class="avatar">A</div>
    <span>ArtKnv<br><small>My Account</small></span>
  </div>
  <nav>
    <a class="active" href="./">⌂ Home</a>
    <a href="#profile">👤 Profile</a>
    <a href="#plus">⭐ Rovolox Plus</a>
    <a href="#messages">✉ Messages</a>
    <a href="#friends">👥 Friends</a>
    <a href="#avatar">🎭 Avatar</a>
    <a href="#inventory">🎒 Inventory</a>
    <a href="#trade">🔄 Trade</a>
    <a href="#communities">🌐 Communities</a>
    <a href="#donate">💎 Donate & Rewards</a>
  </nav>
</aside>

<main>
  <h1>Home</h1>
  <section class="welcome">
    <h2>Welcome to Rovolox!</h2>
    <p>Play, create, explore and hang out with your friends.</p>
    <button onclick="window.open('https://www.roblox.com/games','_blank')">
      ▶ Discover Games
    </button>
  </section>

  <h2>Explore Rovolox</h2>
  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card" id="profile">
      <h3>👤 My Profile</h3>
      <p>View your player profile.</p>
      <a href="#profile">Open Profile →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="card" id="friends">
      <h3>👥 Friends</h3>
      <p>Find friends and connect.</p>
      <a href="#friends">View Friends →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="card" id="avatar">
      <h3>🎭 Avatar</h3>
      <p>Explore your avatar.</p>
      <a href="#avatar">View Avatar →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="card" id="inventory">
      <h3>🎒 Inventory</h3>
      <p>See your items.</p>
      <a href="#inventory">View Inventory →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="card" id="communities">
      <h3>🌐 Communities</h3>
      <p>Discover communities.</p>
      <a href="#communities">Explore →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="card" id="donate">
      <h3>💎 Donate & Rewards</h3>
      <p>Discover rewards and donations.</p>
      <a href="#donate">Explore →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="card" id="messages">
      <h3>✉ Messages</h3>
      <p>Your messages will appear here.</p>
      <a href="#messages">Open Messages →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="card" id="plus">
      <h3>⭐ Rovolox Plus</h3>
      <p>Discover membership features.</p>
      <a href="#plus">Learn More →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="card" id="trade">
      <h3>🔄 Trade</h3>
      <p>Trading features coming soon.</p>
      <a href="#trade">Explore →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <footer>ROVOLOX © 2026 · All rights reserved.</footer>
</main>
</div>
</body>
</html>
